<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Look at the sky"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Porter Robinson"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Nurture"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1815533595"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1839137989"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USQE92000004"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="235518886"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="chan-air"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:07.461"><div begin="00:36.969" end="05:07.461"><p begin="00:36.969" end="00:38.505" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L0"><span begin="00:36.969" end="00:37.230">Is</span> <span begin="00:37.230" end="00:37.475">it</span> <span begin="00:37.475" end="00:38.505">fate?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这可是缘分？</span></p><p begin="00:40.890" end="00:44.549" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:40.890" end="00:41.135">If</span> <span begin="00:41.135" end="00:41.390">it's</span> <span begin="00:41.390" end="00:41.635">not</span> <span begin="00:41.635" end="00:42.040">ea</span><span begin="00:42.040" end="00:42.445">sy,</span> <span begin="00:42.445" end="00:42.685">it</span> <span begin="00:42.685" end="00:43.225">must</span> <span begin="00:43.225" end="00:43.745">not</span> <span begin="00:43.745" end="00:44.549">be</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如果一切来之不易 那就一定不是</span></p><p begin="00:45.344" end="00:46.654" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:45.344" end="00:45.589">At</span> <span begin="00:45.589" end="00:45.819">that</span> <span begin="00:45.819" end="00:46.654">age</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在那个年纪里</span></p><p begin="00:48.949" end="00:52.875" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:48.949" end="00:49.210">I</span> <span begin="00:49.210" end="00:49.470">che</span><span begin="00:49.470" end="00:49.745">rished</span> <span begin="00:49.745" end="00:49.984">the</span> <span begin="00:49.984" end="00:50.340">flo</span><span begin="00:50.340" end="00:50.815">wers</span> <span begin="00:50.815" end="00:51.021">be</span><span begin="00:51.021" end="00:51.535">neath</span> <span begin="00:51.535" end="00:52.060">my</span> <span begin="00:52.060" end="00:52.875">feet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我曾格外珍惜着脚下的花朵</span></p><p begin="00:53.630" end="00:58.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:53.630" end="00:53.890">But</span> <span begin="00:53.890" end="00:54.420">then</span> <span begin="00:54.420" end="00:55.245">some</span><span begin="00:55.245" end="00:55.510">thing</span> <span begin="00:55.510" end="00:56.010">must</span> <span begin="00:56.010" end="00:56.480">have</span> <span begin="00:56.480" end="00:57.045">changed</span> <span begin="00:57.045" end="00:57.585">in</span> <span begin="00:57.585" end="00:58.080">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但我的内心一定发生了些许改变</span></p><p begin="00:58.080" end="01:01.232" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:58.080" end="00:58.625">I</span> <span begin="00:58.625" end="00:59.170">used</span> <span begin="00:59.170" end="00:59.377">to</span> <span begin="00:59.377" end="00:59.887">feel</span> <span begin="00:59.887" end="01:00.422">so</span> <span begin="01:00.422" end="01:01.232">light</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">曾经的我一身轻</span></p><p begin="01:01.958" end="01:03.343" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="01:01.958" end="01:02.193">Now</span> <span begin="01:02.193" end="01:02.493">I'll</span> <span begin="01:02.493" end="01:03.343">try</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如今我愿偿一试</span></p><p begin="01:05.643" end="01:08.248" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="01:05.643" end="01:05.863">I</span> <span begin="01:05.863" end="01:06.468">just</span> <span begin="01:06.468" end="01:07.503">want</span> <span begin="01:07.503" end="01:08.248">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我只是 需要时间</span></p><p begin="01:11.078" end="01:12.928" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="01:11.078" end="01:11.978">Wait</span> <span begin="01:11.978" end="01:12.203">a</span><span begin="01:12.203" end="01:12.928">gain</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">再次等待</span></p><p begin="01:13.218" end="01:17.086" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="01:13.218" end="01:13.738">I</span> <span begin="01:13.738" end="01:14.288">will</span> <span begin="01:14.288" end="01:14.828">be</span> <span begin="01:14.828" end="01:15.328">much</span> <span begin="01:15.328" end="01:16.029">bet</span><span begin="01:16.029" end="01:16.476">ter</span> <span begin="01:16.476" end="01:17.086">then</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">等待着完善自我的到来</span></p><p begin="01:17.371" end="01:20.791" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="01:17.371" end="01:18.156">Hol</span><span begin="01:18.156" end="01:18.401">ding</span> <span begin="01:18.401" end="01:19.261">on,</span> <span begin="01:19.261" end="01:19.486">I</span> <span begin="01:19.486" end="01:20.791">said</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">坚持下去 我告诉自己</span></p><p begin="01:21.591" end="01:26.880" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:21.591" end="01:22.056">"I</span> <span begin="01:22.056" end="01:22.611">will</span> <span begin="01:22.611" end="01:23.166">be</span> <span begin="01:23.166" end="01:23.711">much</span> <span begin="01:23.711" end="01:24.815">bet</span><span begin="01:24.815" end="01:25.855">ter,</span> <span begin="01:25.855" end="01:26.880">then"</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“我一定会苦尽甘来”</span></p><p begin="01:28.880" end="01:32.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:28.880" end="01:29.205">Look</span> <span begin="01:29.205" end="01:29.435">at</span> <span begin="01:29.435" end="01:29.661">the</span> <span begin="01:29.661" end="01:30.660">sky,</span> <span begin="01:30.660" end="01:30.970">I'm</span> <span begin="01:30.970" end="01:31.725">still</span> <span begin="01:31.725" end="01:32.780">here</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我仰望天空 仍旧伫立于此</span></p><p begin="01:33.065" end="01:36.935" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:33.065" end="01:33.326">I'll</span> <span begin="01:33.326" end="01:33.595">be</span> <span begin="01:33.595" end="01:33.850">a</span><span begin="01:33.850" end="01:35.161">live</span> <span begin="01:35.161" end="01:35.915">next</span> <span begin="01:35.915" end="01:36.935">year</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">四季轮转后 我便重获新生</span></p><p begin="01:37.240" end="01:42.020" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:37.240" end="01:37.480">I</span> <span begin="01:37.480" end="01:37.735">can</span> <span begin="01:37.735" end="01:38.270">make</span> <span begin="01:38.270" end="01:39.280">some</span><span begin="01:39.280" end="01:40.095">thing</span> <span begin="01:40.095" end="01:41.150">good,</span> <span begin="01:41.150" end="01:42.020">oh</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:42.165" end="01:45.566"><span begin="01:42.165" end="01:43.195">(Some</span><span begin="01:43.195" end="01:44.260">thing</span> <span begin="01:44.260" end="01:45.566">good)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">缤纷呈现</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我渐入佳境 定将推陈出新</span></p><p begin="01:45.566" end="01:49.436" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:45.566" end="01:45.835">Look</span> <span begin="01:45.835" end="01:46.085">at</span> <span begin="01:46.085" end="01:46.331">the</span> <span begin="01:46.331" end="01:47.145">sky,</span> <span begin="01:47.145" end="01:47.645">I'm</span> <span begin="01:47.645" end="01:48.415">still</span> <span begin="01:48.415" end="01:49.436">here</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">已然时过境迁 我抬头看天</span></p><p begin="01:49.765" end="01:53.391" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:49.765" end="01:50.005">I'll</span> <span begin="01:50.005" end="01:50.285">be</span> <span begin="01:50.285" end="01:50.525">a</span><span begin="01:50.525" end="01:51.815">live</span> <span begin="01:51.815" end="01:52.635">next</span> <span begin="01:52.635" end="01:53.391">year</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来年 生命之章终将翻篇</span></p><p begin="01:53.930" end="01:58.720" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="01:53.930" end="01:54.175">I</span> <span begin="01:54.175" end="01:54.445">can</span> <span begin="01:54.445" end="01:54.975">make</span> <span begin="01:54.975" end="01:56.010">some</span><span begin="01:56.010" end="01:56.811">thing</span> <span begin="01:56.811" end="01:57.835">good,</span> <span begin="01:57.835" end="01:58.720">oh</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="01:58.860" end="02:02.065"><span begin="01:58.860" end="01:59.915">(Some</span><span begin="01:59.915" end="02:00.935">thing</span> <span begin="02:00.935" end="02:02.065">good)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">缤纷呈现</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我定能让美好浮出水面</span></p><p begin="02:02.588" end="02:04.368" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="02:02.588" end="02:02.793">Are</span> <span begin="02:02.793" end="02:03.053">you</span> <span begin="02:03.053" end="02:04.368">close?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">快了吗？</span></p><p begin="02:06.438" end="02:10.043" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="02:06.438" end="02:06.773">Shoul</span><span begin="02:06.773" end="02:06.963">dn't</span> <span begin="02:06.963" end="02:07.223">it</span> <span begin="02:07.223" end="02:07.748">come</span> <span begin="02:07.748" end="02:07.978">to</span> <span begin="02:07.978" end="02:08.218">you</span> <span begin="02:08.218" end="02:08.768">na</span><span begin="02:08.768" end="02:09.268">tural</span><span begin="02:09.268" end="02:10.043">ly?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">难道不应该是它主动向你靠拢吗？</span></p><p begin="02:10.343" end="02:14.548" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20" amll:connect-next="true"><span begin="02:10.343" end="02:10.633">And</span> <span begin="02:10.633" end="02:10.853">e</span><span begin="02:10.853" end="02:11.133">very</span><span begin="02:11.133" end="02:11.393">one</span> <span begin="02:11.393" end="02:12.458">knows:</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">所有人都知道：</span></p><p begin="02:14.548" end="02:18.438" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="02:14.548" end="02:14.818">You're</span> <span begin="02:14.818" end="02:15.063">lo</span><span begin="02:15.063" end="02:15.308">sing</span> <span begin="02:15.308" end="02:15.568">your</span> <span begin="02:15.568" end="02:16.103">gift,</span> <span begin="02:16.103" end="02:16.333">and</span> <span begin="02:16.333" end="02:16.603">it's</span> <span begin="02:16.603" end="02:17.163">plain</span> <span begin="02:17.163" end="02:17.623">to</span> <span begin="02:17.623" end="02:18.438">see</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你的天赋正以显而易见的速度在消失</span></p><p begin="02:19.238" end="02:23.653" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="02:19.238" end="02:19.493">But</span> <span begin="02:19.493" end="02:20.013">then</span> <span begin="02:20.013" end="02:20.803">some</span><span begin="02:20.803" end="02:21.078">thing</span> <span begin="02:21.078" end="02:21.583">must</span> <span begin="02:21.583" end="02:22.108">have</span> <span begin="02:22.108" end="02:22.633">changed</span> <span begin="02:22.633" end="02:23.143">in</span> <span begin="02:23.143" end="02:23.653">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但我的内心一定发生了些许改变</span></p><p begin="02:23.653" end="02:26.549" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="02:23.653" end="02:23.738">I</span> <span begin="02:23.738" end="02:24.164">don't</span> <span begin="02:24.164" end="02:24.719">fear</span> <span begin="02:24.719" end="02:24.944">it</span> <span begin="02:24.944" end="02:25.204">a</span><span begin="02:25.204" end="02:25.484">ny</span><span begin="02:25.484" end="02:26.549">more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如今我已不再惧怕</span></p><p begin="02:27.569" end="02:29.079" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="02:27.569" end="02:27.799">Now</span> <span begin="02:27.799" end="02:28.069">I'm</span> <span begin="02:28.069" end="02:29.079">sure</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:31.754" end="02:33.284"><span begin="02:31.754" end="02:32.264">(I'm</span> <span begin="02:32.264" end="02:33.284">sure)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我坚信着</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我肯定着</span></p><p begin="02:35.714" end="02:39.359" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="02:35.714" end="02:35.924">Look</span> <span begin="02:35.924" end="02:36.149">at</span> <span begin="02:36.149" end="02:36.414">the</span> <span begin="02:36.414" end="02:37.094">sky,</span> <span begin="02:37.094" end="02:37.664">I'm</span> <span begin="02:37.664" end="02:38.509">still</span> <span begin="02:38.509" end="02:39.359">here</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">注视着天空 我仍在此地</span></p><p begin="02:39.844" end="02:43.629" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:39.844" end="02:40.114">I'll</span> <span begin="02:40.114" end="02:40.374">be</span> <span begin="02:40.374" end="02:40.614">a</span><span begin="02:40.614" end="02:41.764">live</span> <span begin="02:41.764" end="02:42.739">next</span> <span begin="02:42.739" end="02:43.629">year</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我会在明年 重现活力</span></p><p begin="02:43.999" end="02:48.649" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:43.999" end="02:44.239">I</span> <span begin="02:44.239" end="02:44.489">can</span> <span begin="02:44.489" end="02:45.029">make</span> <span begin="02:45.029" end="02:46.049">some</span><span begin="02:46.049" end="02:46.894">thing</span> <span begin="02:46.894" end="02:47.899">good,</span> <span begin="02:47.899" end="02:48.649">oh</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="02:48.959" end="02:51.919"><span begin="02:48.959" end="02:49.949">(Some</span><span begin="02:49.949" end="02:51.039">thing</span> <span begin="02:51.039" end="02:51.919">good)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">缤纷呈现</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我一定能 有所成绩</span></p><p begin="02:52.344" end="02:56.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:52.344" end="02:52.644">Look</span> <span begin="02:52.644" end="02:52.884">at</span> <span begin="02:52.884" end="02:53.134">the</span> <span begin="02:53.134" end="02:53.719">sky,</span> <span begin="02:53.719" end="02:54.414">I'm</span> <span begin="02:54.414" end="02:55.209">still</span> <span begin="02:55.209" end="02:56.029">here</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">任凭时过境迁 我抬头看天</span></p><p begin="02:56.477" end="03:00.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:56.477" end="02:56.801">I'll</span> <span begin="02:56.801" end="02:57.046">be</span> <span begin="02:57.046" end="02:57.276">a</span><span begin="02:57.276" end="02:58.591">live</span> <span begin="02:58.591" end="02:59.381">next</span> <span begin="02:59.381" end="03:00.340">year</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">来年 生命之章终将翻篇</span></p><p begin="03:00.660" end="03:05.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="03:00.660" end="03:00.925">I</span> <span begin="03:00.925" end="03:01.195">can</span> <span begin="03:01.195" end="03:01.715">make</span> <span begin="03:01.715" end="03:02.745">some</span><span begin="03:02.745" end="03:03.540">thing</span> <span begin="03:03.540" end="03:04.590">good,</span> <span begin="03:04.590" end="03:05.270">oh</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="03:05.620" end="03:08.750"><span begin="03:05.620" end="03:06.640">(Some</span><span begin="03:06.640" end="03:07.715">thing</span> <span begin="03:07.715" end="03:08.750">good)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">缤纷呈现</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我定能让美好浮出水面</span></p><p begin="03:26.766" end="03:32.731" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="03:26.766" end="03:27.556">Wait</span> <span begin="03:27.556" end="03:27.806">a</span><span begin="03:27.806" end="03:28.351">gain,</span> <span begin="03:28.856" end="03:29.366">I</span> <span begin="03:29.366" end="03:29.891">will</span> <span begin="03:29.891" end="03:30.431">be</span> <span begin="03:30.431" end="03:30.941">much</span> <span begin="03:30.941" end="03:31.696">bet</span><span begin="03:31.696" end="03:31.941">ter</span> <span begin="03:31.941" end="03:32.731">then</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">再次等待着 等待着更为完善的自我</span></p><p begin="03:34.911" end="03:42.550" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="03:34.911" end="03:35.151">And</span> <span begin="03:35.151" end="03:35.886">sud</span><span begin="03:35.886" end="03:36.146">den</span><span begin="03:36.146" end="03:36.841">ly,</span> <span begin="03:37.201" end="03:37.726">I've</span> <span begin="03:37.726" end="03:38.226">res</span><span begin="03:38.226" end="03:38.776">tored</span> <span begin="03:38.776" end="03:39.185">your</span> <span begin="03:39.185" end="03:40.580">faith</span> <span begin="03:40.580" end="03:41.375">in</span> <span begin="03:41.375" end="03:42.550">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那刹风华间 我让你重拾了对我的信心</span></p><p begin="03:44.550" end="03:49.451" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="03:44.550" end="03:44.855">Look</span> <span begin="03:44.855" end="03:45.095">at</span> <span begin="03:45.095" end="03:45.315">the</span> <span begin="03:45.315" end="03:45.448">s</span><span begin="03:45.448" end="03:49.451">ky</span><span ttm:role="x-tr